{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09325","headline":"观早朝 · 韦应物","name":"观早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伐鼓通严城，车马溢广躔。\n煌煌列明烛，朝服照华鲜。\n金门杳深沈，尚听清漏传。\n河汉忽已没，司阍啓晨关。\n丹殿据龙首，崔嵬对南山。\n寒生千门里，日照双阙间。\n禁旅下成列，炉香起中天。\n辉辉覩明圣，济济行俊贤。\n媿无鸳鹭姿，短翮空飞还。\n谁当假毛羽，云路相追攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}